WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A clock can tell you twelve minutes have passed.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
It cannot tell you what state your brain has entered.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Zen12 offers short audio sessions in four styles.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The seller compares one session with an hour of meditation.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Independent research does not establish that product claim.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Choose the format, read the evidence, keep a free option.
